*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0022
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-09-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-10-05 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 442
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0022.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 BUREAU-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
    *> DEBT TO INCOME RATIO
    05 DTI-RATIO          PIC 9V99.
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 APPL-DECISION      PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CREDIT-CUTOFF
    DISPLAY "APPL-DECISION=" APPL-DECISION
    STOP RUN.
CREDIT-CUTOFF.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN BUREAU-SCORE >= 740 AND DTI-RATIO < 0.40
            MOVE 'A' TO APPL-DECISION
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER - LIMIT 930 PER 1998 POLICY
        WHEN BUREAU-SCORE >= 620
            MOVE 'R' TO APPL-DECISION
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'D' TO APPL-DECISION
    END-EVALUATE.
